<title>KAZAKHSTAN: SOCCER-KAZAKHSTAN BEAT IRAQ IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-KAZAKHSTAN BEAT IRAQ IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-06-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan beat Iraq 3-1</p>
<p>(halftime 2-0) in their World Cup Asian zone group nine</p>
<p>qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Kazakhstan - Nurken Mazbayev 4, Vladimir Loginov 36, Alexei</p>
<p>Klishin 61</p>
<p>Iraq - Sadiq Saadun 56</p>
<p>Attendance: 8,000.</p>
<p>    Final standings P   W   D   L   F   A   PTS</p>
<p> Kazakhstan	   4   4   0   0   15   2   12</p>
<p> Iraq		   4   2   0   2   14   8    6</p>
<p> Pakistan	     4   0   0   4    3  22    0</p>
</text>
